  ('LR-0122', 'Logical Reasoning', 'Cause and effect', 'Cause and effect pairs', 'moderate', 'Examwise original question. PMDC MDCAT curriculum 2025, Logical Reasoning learning outcome 5.6', 'Statement I: Many people bought sweaters and room heaters.
