  ('LR-0125', 'Logical Reasoning', 'Cause and effect', 'Cause and effect pairs', 'easy', 'Examwise original question. PMDC MDCAT curriculum 2025, Logical Reasoning learning outcome 5.6', 'Statement I: A large number of fish died in a lake.
