What is the relationship between the two statements?', '["Statement I is the cause and Statement II is its effect", "Statement II is the cause and Statement I is its effect", "Both statements are effects of a common cause", "The two statements are not causally related"]', 1, 'Toxic waste poisons fish, so II causes I.', '{"0": "Dead fish do not make a factory dump waste.", "2": "The waste directly explains the deaths.", "3": "The two are clearly linked."}'),
